  - IEDB
  - MHC binding prediction
  - ESM-2
  - protein language model
  - SHAP
  - explainable AI
abstract: >
  A six-stage computational pipeline that curates T-cell assay data from
  IEDB and CEDAR, verifies peptides against UniProt reference sequences,
  annotates MHC class I/II binding, engineers sequence, physicochemical,
  MHC-binding, and ESM-2 protein language model features, trains an
  explainable weighted ensemble classifier (logistic regression, SVM,
  tree ensembles, and XGBoost) under leakage-aware nested cross-validation,
  and validates the resulting model on an independent external peptide set.
